            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "DiamondLil"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I omitted the flour, sugar and baking soda and used a box of white cake mix in it's place. I also adding 1/4 tsp nutmeg to give it a \"spice cake\" taste. I frosted with my own allspice cream cheese frosting (which is your basic cream cheese frosting using vanilla and 3/4 tsp all spice). This is a super easy recipe even if you aren't as lazy as me and use cake mix. The spices are not overpowering."
          },
