              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "lg48tn"
            },
            "reviewBody": "YUM!!! This is better than any other apple cake I've made. I sliced through some of the apples to make smaller pieces (You can do this while they're still in the can) and added a generous 1/2 cup of \nmini chocolate chips. Thanks for such a delicious recipe!",
            "datePublished": "2011-10-15T11:49:37.743Z"
          },
